################################################################################
#                                                                              #
#            VERA Reactor-Aware Core Simulator Input Parser                    #
#                                                                              #
################################################################################

The reactor-aware input parser react2xml.pl is installed under

   bin/react2xml.pl

The examples are installed under

   example/react2xml

Each of the subdirectories under the above example directory has a
run_example.sh script that will run the example, demonstrating how to run the
code.  Justs open each run_example.sh script and look at what it does.

More info on how to run the parser is given by:

   react2xml.pl --help

Enjoy!
